From knarr k37: learned facts are per instance, so a gateway with N discovered models (one engine instance each, e.g. 300 OpenRouter slugs) fetches the full /models document N times. Add a public, explicit sharing mechanism: e.g. probe_model_capabilities_f(models=>[...]) returns the learned map and a public import_learned_capabilities(\%map) (or a shared store object passed at construction, keyed by metadata URL, with TTL) so one probe fills many instances. Keep 'no hidden network I/O'. Update ADR 0032.
